und-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;모집 기간 종료 후\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e, \u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e헬름은 \u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e2022\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e년 \u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e12\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e월 내에 일반 모집\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e, \u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e소셜 포인트 모집\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e,\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.27in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e몰드\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e 아이템을 통해 모집할 수 있게 됩니다\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e. (\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e신규 지휘관 모집 및 튜토리얼 모집에서는 출현하지 않습니다\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e)\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e신규 이벤트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in; padding-left: 40px;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;1）스토리\u003c/span\u003e 이벤트\u003c/span\u003e: No Caller ID\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e아무도 없는 지상에서 전송된 의문의 메세지\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e카운터스 스쿼드는 이를 조사하기 위해 지상을 탐색합니다\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e스테이지를 클리어하면 성장 재료를 획득하실 수 있습니다\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e이벤트 미션 클리어를 하거나 특정 캐릭터를 사용하여 스테이지를 클리어할 경우\u003c/span\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e일정 확률로 이벤트 아이템 \u003c/span\u003e[\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e장난감 송신탑\u003c/span\u003e]\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e을 획득할 수 있습니다\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e장난감 송신탑\u003c/span\u003e]\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e은 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e이벤트 상점에서 모집 티켓 혹은 연구 재료 등의 다양한 보상으로 교환하실 수 있습니다\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e이벤트 진행 기간\u003c/span\u003e: 2022\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e년 \u003c/span\u003e11\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e월 \u003c/span\u003e10\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e일(목) 서버 오픈 이후 \u003c/span\u003e~ 2022\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e년 \u003c/span\u003e11\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e월 \u003c/span\u003e24\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e일(목) \u003c/span\u003e4:59:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e참여 방식\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan lang=\"zh-CN\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e로비 화면 \u0026rarr; 이벤트 \u0026rarr; \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003eNo Caller ID\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"line-height: 100%; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-left: 0.56in; margin-top: 0.04in; margin-bottom: 0.04in;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e2）협동 작전(\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\"\u003e이벤트 지연\u003c/span\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"SE-af44cc1e-ef86-42ca-9ea5-428f4455f642\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"SE-54a3c3b6-12d1-445d-9f05-b72d445d553f\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; - 5명의 지휘관이 함께 협동하여 보스 Alteisen MK.VI를 상대하는 실시간 협력 모드입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"SE-1e0a4741-69c0-4e91-be33-76127570707d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"SE-d31944cc-6cec-4078-9be8-3fb7ae756c5b\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; - 협동 작전은 친구나 유니온 멤버, 혹은 자동 매칭을 통해 진행하실 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"SE-f1af0810-eca8-44d1-91d7-0a1a11699de7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"SE-b4e12d8c-5abd-4749-9451-3d788839e009\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; - 보스를 처치하여 획득한 고철은 고철 상점에서 쥬얼, 육성 재료 등 보상으로 교환하실 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"SE-0f53ce40-827d-437c-973e-334145341a0a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"SE-a3cba569-5f19-4f88-8438-c5fbab19de36\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \"\u003e​\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"SE-9322db5b-01d7-4c51-abb3-033f0eea1b75\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"SE-de49a05f-3dce-4df3-b129-e730cc26a4d0\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \"\u003e\u003cs\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e▶ 이벤트 기간 :\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/s\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan id=\"SE-04bedcba-0a70-40a7-9ee2-4707f2f87a0d\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \"\u003e\u003cs\u003e 2022년 11월 11일(금) 12:00 ~ 11월 13일(일) 23:59:59\u003c/s\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"SE-8d4213bb-1769-4ae3-aace-6d3a994259c2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \